{
  "id": "ghost-diary",
  "name": "horror",
  "category": "幽灵日记",
  "description": "一页幽灵留下的日记",
  "trigger": {
    "type": "random",
    "probability": 0.008,
    "conditions": []
  },
  "variables": {
    "content": {
      "type": "text",
      "maxLength": 300,
      "description": "幽灵日记内容，应该充满幽怨或执念"
    },
    "date": {
      "type": "date",
      "description": "记录日期"
    },
    "ghostName": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "幽灵名称"
    },
    "hauntedPlace": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "出没地点"
    },
    "emotion": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "情感",
      "options": [
        "怨恨",
        "悲伤",
        "思念",
        "愤怒",
        "平静"
      ],
      "default": "怨恨"
    }
  },
  "promptTemplate": "请生成一张「horror」的内容。\n\n背景信息：\n- 当前场景：{{scene}}\n- 发送者：{{sender}}\n- 接收者：{{recipient}}\n\n要求：\n1. 内容要符合该卡片的风格和情境\n2. 语气要自然、有代入感\n3. 字数控制在100-300字之间\n\n请直接输出内容，不要有其他说明。",
  "style": {
    "theme": "handwritten",
    "colors": [
      "#2c1810",
      "#6b2020",
      "#3a2020"
    ],
    "mood": "一页幽灵留下的日记"
  },
  "rarity": "epic",
  "collectible": true
}